          "Missionary discipleship becomes the ordinary identity of the baptized under this ranking. The outward movement is not pure clerical specialty; it is the form of a joy that cannot help but speak. Structures, schedules, and pure self-referential debates are judged by whether they serve that outward joy or replace it with pure interior consumption of religious goods.",
          "Order the Church outward under the joy of the Gospel. Prefer Francis’s missionary ranking to pure closed self-maintenance as the definition of fidelity. Let the shareable joy still judge the structures under God.",
