          "When diocesan priesthood is reduced to programming, activism, or bureaucratic presence, Vianney becomes difficult to admire except as a legend. When it is ordered again to Mass and absolution, he becomes possible to imitate in spirit even where his extremes of penance are not copied in detail.",
