          "A culture that treats pain as pure scandal or pure medical failure will not understand this saint. A culture that chases extraordinary phenomena for their own sake will also misunderstand him. The middle path is dogma: the Cross saves, and members of the Body may be configured to it in hidden or manifest ways under God’s providence.",
